          "text": "はい、私の兄です。",
          "translation": "Yes, he’s my older brother."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "text": "何を教えていますか。",
          "translation": "What does he teach?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "日本語を教えています。",
          "translation": "He teaches Japanese."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Who teaches Japanese?",
      "choices": [
        "Speaker A",
        "Speaker B",
        "B’s girlfriend",
        "B’s older brother"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "explanation": "私の兄 means my older brother. 教えています is a form of 教える (teach), used here for his ongoing work."
    },
    {
